@@ -11,6 +11,12 @@ Release date: TBA
 
 * astroid has been upgraded to 2.6.0
 
+* ``pyreverse`` now uses PEP 484 type annotations (of class attributes, and of
+  ``__init__`` arguments assigned to instance attributes) to display the type of
+  attributes in class diagrams. ``Optional`` is added when the default value is ``None``.
+
+  Closes #1548
+
 * Fix false positive ``useless-type-doc`` on ignored argument using ``pylint.extensions.docparams``
   when a function was typed using pep484 but not inside the docstring.
 
